    "Id": "chassisdef_wraith_WRT-TR7",
    "Name": "Wraith",
    "Details": "The Wraith TR7 was designed in close collaboration with the Death Commandos, the elite forces of the CCAF. One of the key requirements was that the design should complement the often used Raven II, allowing the two 'Mech variants to work in tandem for covert ops and headhunting missions. Unlike the other \"Wing\" variants, the TR7 sports stealth armor and carries a powerful Angel ECM system. Two Inner Sphere ER Medium Lasers and one Clan-grade ER PPC also provides an improved attack profile compared to the other models.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Ubiquitous</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Wraith"
  },
